# Prosthetic Hand Demonstration

This video demonstrates my AI-powered prosthetic hand responding to my finger movements in real time. Using a webcam and MediaPipe, the Python program tracks 21 landmarks on my hand and sends commands to an Arduino Uno, which controls five servo motors inside the 3D-printed prosthetic hand.

